?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657480/extras/da36267fff1e5d02e2f34e7a1daf1cf7.poster.avif?t=1784033219\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657480/extras/da36267fff1e5d02e2f34e7a1daf1cf7.webm?t=1784033219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657480/extras/da36267fff1e5d02e2f34e7a1daf1cf7.mp4?t=1784033219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUROMA is a short incremental clicker about isolation. Dig through your trash-strewn floor mining it for resources. Hire worms, dung beetles, and use various upgrades to dig deeper and deeper.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The corporate shadow-regime sees everything. To <strong>them</strong>, the sun is surveillance; to you, dawn is the enemy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657480/extras/ffc2afe0a93630d72a7c62c340d18651.poster.avif?t=1784033219\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657480/extras/ffc2afe0a93630d72a7c62c340d18651.webm?t=1784033219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657480/extras/ffc2afe0a93630d72a7c62c340d18651.mp4?t=1784033219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is the Terminal PET. Is the PET the one voice of truth, or another manipulator?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=